      <direction placement="above">
        <direction-type>
          <words default-y="40.00" relative-x="-203.00" relative-y="217.00" id="e3f7bff774e48be3a">«Я к жизни призываю вас, скрытые стремленья!
</words>
          <words id="e3d78dba4f393b79e">Вы, утонувшие в темных глубинах
</words>
          <words id="ef04ed5e7a4d25afb">Духа творящего, вы, боязливые
</words>
          <words id="e7b660df857dbf52c">Жизни зародыши, вам дерзновенье приношу!»
</words>
          <words id="e7557b614536dc115">            (А. Скрябин, «Поэма экстаза») </words>
          </direction-type>
        <staff>1</staff>
        </direction>
      <direction placement="above">
        <direction-type>
          <words default-y="40.00" relative-x="384.00" relative-y="217.00" id="e4969090398833f49">« Je vous appelle à la vie, ô forces mysterieuses!
</words>
          <words id="eb7ecae12e966d562">Noyées dans les obscures profondeurs
</words>
          <words id="ebe9d38d4047f1107">De l’esprit créateur, craintives
</words>
          <words id="ef20d6c9fef8cd695">Ebauches de vie, à vous j’apporte l’audace! »
</words>
          <words id="e7d4e9696535191f8">              (A. Scriabine, </words>
          <words font-style="italic" id="ea17a18c38508f18f">Le Poème de l'Extase</words>
          <words font-style="normal" id="eb15798caa60bf381">)</words>
          </direction-type>
        <staff>1</staff>
        </direction>
      <direction placement="above">
        <direction-type>
          <words default-x="-38.22" default-y="40.00" font-weight="bold" id="e15eb025834b0b761">Allegro. Impetuoso. Con stravaganza</words>
          </direction-type>
        <staff>1</staff>
        </direction>
      <direction placement="below">
        <direction-type>
          <words default-y="40.00" relative-x="-8.00" relative-y="-99.00" font-style="italic" font-family="MScore Text" id="e01640ae7208105c1"></words>
          <words font-family="Times New Roman" id="e12d32d2342832b74"> sotto voce</words>
          </direction-type>
        <staff>1</staff>
        </direction>
